          "location": "Beregost",
          "actors": 0,
          "droppedPcActors": [],
          "narration": "Bram Halloway, Sefa Marrin and Pell Dunmore stand together before a patron's door in Beregost. They met this morning and were hired together for one errand that must be finished in this town before nightfall. Hammers ring from the smithies, smoke hangs over the rooftops, and the sun is already sliding west over the Trade Way. The errand has been named, but its details are still unspoken. All three turn toward the closed door, and the street waits for the first move. What does the company do before the light goes?",
