          "location": "The ruin below Beregost",
          "actors": 0,
          "droppedPcActors": [],
          "narration": "The afternoon light stops at the lip of the ruin, where worn stone steps fall away into a shadow that does not quite match the day. Cold air rises from below, carrying dust and no smell of rot. Bram Halloway, Sefa Marrin and Pell Dunmore stand here together, each with what they carried in and each with the same open road behind them back toward Beregost. Somewhere below, something is listening, and it is in no hurry. Nothing has been decided yet. Who moves first, and what they make of the silence at the top of the stairs, is still hanging in the air.",
